  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Each player is dealt one card face down\n2. Without looking at their card, players hold it to their forehead so all other players can see it\n3. Players look around at all other players' cards\n4. A round of betting occurs (similar to poker)\n5. Players can fold, call, or raise based on what they see\n6. After betting, remaining players showdown\n7. The player with the highest card wins the pot\n8. If multiple players tie for highest, they split the pot",
    Player: "1. Each player is dealt one card face down\n2. Without looking at their card, players hold it to their forehead so all other players can see it\n3. Players look around at all other players' cards\n4. A round of betting occurs (similar to poker)\n5. Players can fold, call, or raise based on what they see\n6. After betting, remaining players showdown\n7. The player with the highest card wins the pot\n8. If multiple players tie for highest, they split the pot",
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest card (or convincing others you do) when players showdown, or by being the only player not to fold.',
